* Function Breakdown

This is where I break the features in functions


1. Playing vs a computer (MVP)
functions;
	randomPick(); | assign a random move| input = none | output = A random Pick
	user1Pick(); | assign the user move | Input = eventlistener | output = user1's Pick
	user2Pick(); | Assign the Bot a move | randomPick(); | output = user2's Pick
	gameLogic();| compare picks and determined the winner| input = user1Pick , user2Pick | output = who is the winner

2. keeping score of between games 
function;
	updateScoreboard();| update the scoreboard of the winner| input = winner| output = none


3. score being kept on local Storage
functions;
	saveScore(); | save the score of the game| input = the score| output = none
	displayScore(); | pull the score from locoal storage| input = none| output = the score


4. Having a computer vs computer game that runs on its own
